WEBVTT

00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:09.150
The milk you bought with your own money really tastes good.

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:13.280
I can't wait until the cherry blossom viewing season comes.

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:19.830
There goes my pleasure...

00:00:21.440 --> 00:00:25.040
Whoa, it hit someone. That's hilarious!

00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:27.210
Hey, hand me the ball.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.270
Okay, here.

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:33.770
Hey, you soiled it!

00:00:33.770 --> 00:00:36.010
You're going to pay for damages.

00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:41.180
Hand me your wallet. We have to buy a new ball.

00:00:42.350 --> 00:00:44.980
You're the ones who have to pay!

00:00:46.520 --> 00:00:48.820
Geez, what are you doing, getting yourself bullied like that!

00:00:48.820 --> 00:00:51.020
Hey, bitch!

00:00:54.970 --> 00:00:57.070
Isn't she kind of creepy?

00:00:57.070 --> 00:00:58.540
L-Let's go.

00:01:00.750 --> 00:01:02.020
Benisu-san.

00:01:02.020 --> 00:01:03.660
Thank you very much.

00:01:04.350 --> 00:01:08.540
Taking care of one's subordinates is part of my elegant duties as a boss.

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:11.450
I'm so happy to be taken care of by you!

00:01:12.020 --> 00:01:13.920
Come on, let's hurry home.

00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:14.850
Right!

00:02:59.510 --> 00:03:03.820
So it was quite a thrilling afternoon!

00:03:04.290 --> 00:03:06.030
Yeah, I understand that, but...

00:03:06.610 --> 00:03:09.120
...why do you have to come all the way here to tell me about it?

00:03:09.550 --> 00:03:12.710
Well, it was a great adventure for me.

00:03:13.100 --> 00:03:16.550
I'll wash your back, so listen to the rest of my story, Ren-nii!

00:03:20.380 --> 00:03:23.680
No, what am I embarrassed about? He's a guy!

00:03:27.420 --> 00:03:28.890
Come on, let's go in!

00:03:28.890 --> 00:03:31.450
No, I don't think I want to!

00:03:32.260 --> 00:03:32.890
Ren-nii!

00:03:38.230 --> 00:03:40.860
Geez, he's dangerous.

00:03:40.860 --> 00:03:44.070
You're the one who's dangerous!

00:03:46.540 --> 00:03:49.280
What are you lurking about naked, you pervert!

00:03:49.280 --> 00:03:51.290
Take this! And this!

00:03:57.490 --> 00:03:59.500
Huh? What is it?

00:04:04.320 --> 00:04:06.450
Ow!

00:04:06.800 --> 00:04:09.060
What in the world is this?

00:04:12.420 --> 00:04:15.520
Can't she reply by ordinary means?

00:04:15.520 --> 00:04:18.320
But, aren't you looking forward to the flower watching, Haru?

00:04:25.360 --> 00:04:26.590
What's the matter, Haru?

00:04:26.590 --> 00:04:28.220
Letting out a sigh like that.

00:04:28.220 --> 00:04:30.650
I was just thinking about some things.

00:04:30.650 --> 00:04:31.870
Do you have any worries?

00:04:31.870 --> 00:04:33.970
N-No, it's all right.

00:04:33.970 --> 00:04:35.530
I'll go clean up.

00:04:37.320 --> 00:04:40.270
He's been acting strangely since yesterday.

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:42.540
You're dense, Uesugi.

00:04:42.540 --> 00:04:44.470
Whoa! Y-You startled me!

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:48.970
I know just what Chiharu-kun was thinking of right now.

00:04:48.970 --> 00:04:51.660
Hmm, I'd like to know.

00:04:51.660 --> 00:04:52.710
No way.

00:04:54.430 --> 00:04:57.190
You better tell me, you dog!

00:04:59.480 --> 00:05:01.940
Yes, I'm a dog.

00:05:01.940 --> 00:05:05.090
Chiharu-kun is in love.

00:05:05.090 --> 00:05:07.280
What? With whom?

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:09.930
My bitch instincts tell me...

00:05:09.930 --> 00:05:11.780
Girl instincts, you mean.

00:05:11.780 --> 00:05:14.870
The person is in the house.

00:05:14.870 --> 00:05:16.080
Are you serious?

00:05:16.510 --> 00:05:20.130
If I'm wrong, you may punish me to your heart's desire.

00:05:20.460 --> 00:05:22.960
If you say that, I'll really do it.

00:05:24.010 --> 00:05:26.270
Please, please! Do it to me!

00:05:27.280 --> 00:05:29.550
I-I-I'm sorry!

00:05:29.550 --> 00:05:30.470
I lied.

00:05:33.640 --> 00:05:36.730
Kurukkuu! Poppo!

00:05:48.620 --> 00:05:49.450
Yo.

00:05:52.950 --> 00:05:57.650
Poppo! What Onee-chan will do for her brother...

00:05:58.280 --> 00:06:01.960
Her brother will do for Onee-chan...

00:06:04.910 --> 00:06:06.970
Yume Ojou-sama, excuse me.

00:06:10.700 --> 00:06:13.640
Team Yume Ojou-sama members are all here.

00:06:13.640 --> 00:06:19.140
Haru, let me start off by saying that we're on your side.

00:06:19.140 --> 00:06:21.520
Right, we're rooting for you, Haru-kun!

00:06:22.180 --> 00:06:25.530
I appreciate the thoughts, but why?

00:06:26.480 --> 00:06:30.030
Haru, I'll get to the point. You're in love!

00:06:31.490 --> 00:06:33.490
H-How did you know?

00:06:35.440 --> 00:06:37.000
It's the protagonist augmentation.

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:39.010
The protagonist augmentation is awesome, you know.

00:06:39.010 --> 00:06:42.290
Even if the cockpit area explodes, he's alive without a scratch.

00:06:43.300 --> 00:06:47.250
He can go out with as many girls as he wants.

00:06:47.250 --> 00:06:50.210
Although it can get quite ugly when the boost fails.

00:06:50.210 --> 00:06:53.510
A protagonist is quite impressive.

00:06:53.510 --> 00:06:55.950
So, who is it?

00:06:55.950 --> 00:06:57.480
Come on, tell me.

00:06:57.480 --> 00:07:01.190
Huh? Do I have to tell you?

00:07:03.730 --> 00:07:06.860
A man's got to have courage. You have to go for anything.

00:07:07.320 --> 00:07:09.860
We want to support your love life.

00:07:10.480 --> 00:07:12.360
We want you to become happy.

00:07:12.360 --> 00:07:16.250
I feel so grateful. I'm glad to be alive!

00:07:17.230 --> 00:07:18.540
So, who is it?

00:07:19.520 --> 00:07:22.080
The person that I like is...

00:07:22.450 --> 00:07:25.590
Don't tell me it's Yume.

00:07:30.720 --> 00:07:32.260
T-To be honest...

00:07:35.610 --> 00:07:37.950
He looked at Yume for a second.

00:07:37.950 --> 00:07:40.000
As I thought, it's Yume!

00:07:40.710 --> 00:07:41.850
What should I do?

00:07:41.850 --> 00:07:43.350
Benisu-san!

00:07:46.110 --> 00:07:48.030
Um, this isn't the time to tell gags.

00:07:48.030 --> 00:07:50.320
I-It's not a gag, Ren-nii!

00:07:51.220 --> 00:07:53.820
He must be feeling bashful and can't tell the truth.

00:07:53.820 --> 00:07:56.320
Oh, that's possible. Good going, Yume!

00:07:56.780 --> 00:07:58.500
Then, who is it?

00:07:58.500 --> 00:07:59.660
Don't tell me, Hato-nee?

00:07:59.660 --> 00:08:03.670
And I'm telling you that it's Benisu-san!

00:08:04.860 --> 00:08:06.810
Oh, so it isn't Yume.

00:08:06.810 --> 00:08:08.190
Are you serious?

00:08:08.190 --> 00:08:11.050
You're always being teased by her, so it came as something unexpected.

00:08:11.050 --> 00:08:14.050
W-Well, it's quite embarrassing...

00:08:14.050 --> 00:08:17.710
Is it okay to ask what you like about her?

00:08:17.710 --> 00:08:20.390
She's strong-willed and a person of firm character.

00:08:20.830 --> 00:08:23.670
And, although you may not understand...

00:08:23.670 --> 00:08:24.890
...she's kind.

00:08:24.890 --> 00:08:27.990
Right, right. I know it very well.

00:08:29.340 --> 00:08:31.480
I can't understand it at all.

00:08:31.480 --> 00:08:35.110
But, I'll back you up so that your romance comes true!

00:08:35.110 --> 00:08:37.440
I-I appreciate your help.

00:08:37.440 --> 00:08:39.660
For example: push her down to the floor.

00:08:44.180 --> 00:08:46.500
I'll get myself killed...

00:08:46.500 --> 00:08:49.450
You have to go out on a date.

00:08:49.450 --> 00:08:51.680
Hmm, where to?

00:08:51.680 --> 00:08:53.590
How about a ramen tour?

00:08:54.050 --> 00:08:58.800
You keep on eating ramen until "ramen" becomes a suffix for your vocabulary.

00:08:58.800 --> 00:09:02.640
T-That's not a bad idea, but...

00:09:02.640 --> 00:09:07.540
In other words, you have to take her where she wants to go.

00:09:07.540 --> 00:09:10.020
In the case of Beni-kou...

00:09:10.020 --> 00:09:11.320
...it's got to be that place!

00:09:15.020 --> 00:09:17.570
All right! He saved the pinch!

00:09:17.570 --> 00:09:21.260
The opponent's offense surely had us on the edge of our seats, Benisu-san.

00:09:21.260 --> 00:09:26.180
Right. Come to think of it, it's unusual for you to ask me out to events like this.

00:09:26.180 --> 00:09:27.750
I'd understand it if it was Ren.

00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:30.000
I thought it would be nice once in a while.

00:09:30.720 --> 00:09:33.020
Cheering for the Bays gets me fired up!

00:09:33.020 --> 00:09:37.370
I wish I could bring over Ren to teach him how wonderful this is.

00:09:38.430 --> 00:09:39.550
Right.

00:09:40.190 --> 00:09:42.250
How come you didn't invite Ren?

00:09:42.250 --> 00:09:43.680
Since you two get along with each other.

00:09:45.300 --> 00:09:47.190
That's because...

00:09:47.190 --> 00:09:48.510
Me and Benisu-san...

00:09:49.810 --> 00:09:52.300
Yeah, it's our turn at bat!

00:09:52.300 --> 00:09:54.450
I'm all fired up!

00:09:56.150 --> 00:09:58.200
Way too much...

00:09:59.610 --> 00:10:02.750
No, a routine popup to the pitcher...

00:10:02.750 --> 00:10:06.670
If only Ren were here, I could smack him to relieve my stress!

00:10:06.670 --> 00:10:10.710
B-Benisu-san, you mention Ren-nii's name quite often.

00:10:11.300 --> 00:10:12.990
Huh? I do?

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:16.790
Now that you mention it, you're right.

00:10:16.790 --> 00:10:19.220
Maybe I'm attracted to him.

00:10:20.450 --> 00:10:21.890
Benisu-san...

00:10:22.400 --> 00:10:25.460
Just a little, you know, just a little.

00:10:25.460 --> 00:10:29.000
Don't tell him about this, since he'll get the wrong idea.

00:10:30.190 --> 00:10:31.100
What's the matter?

00:10:31.680 --> 00:10:33.550
No, it's nothing.

00:10:33.550 --> 00:10:36.120
Come on, Benisu-san, the next batter's up.

00:10:36.120 --> 00:10:37.320
Oh, right.

00:10:37.320 --> 00:10:43.830
Go, go, Kinjou! Hit a homer, yeah!

00:10:43.830 --> 00:10:44.830
Go!

00:10:48.380 --> 00:10:50.830
Yo, Haru. How did things go last night?

00:10:52.210 --> 00:10:55.670
No vibes. I'm thinking of giving up.

00:10:56.000 --> 00:10:56.830
Huh?

00:10:57.820 --> 00:11:00.610
Hey, are going to give up so easily?

00:11:00.610 --> 00:11:02.180
Yo, slackers!

00:11:03.160 --> 00:11:04.020
Yo.

00:11:04.020 --> 00:11:05.010
Good morning.

00:11:05.550 --> 00:11:07.980
Hey, tuck in your shirt.

00:11:07.980 --> 00:11:09.200
You're so pathetic.

00:11:09.000 --> 00:11:10.350
Oh, sorry.

00:11:10.350 --> 00:11:12.350
You're really sloppy.

00:11:12.350 --> 00:11:15.500
I'm more than happy the way I am.

00:11:15.120 --> 00:11:16.010
Thanks.

00:11:16.010 --> 00:11:18.820
I'm going to give my best at cleaning duties!

00:11:19.610 --> 00:11:20.990
Strange guy.

00:11:20.990 --> 00:11:25.740
Well, if a low ranking guy like him is pumped up like that, then I have to do the same!

00:11:25.740 --> 00:11:29.020
Right, I'm going to work, too!

00:11:52.630 --> 00:11:53.810
Sake sure tastes good.

00:11:54.540 --> 00:11:57.570
Argh, how can anybody drink out of this?

00:11:57.570 --> 00:11:59.750
Kojuurou, bring over the whole keg!

00:11:59.750 --> 00:12:00.150
Yes!

00:12:00.150 --> 00:12:02.150
The whole keg?

00:12:04.020 --> 00:12:05.870
Here it is.

00:12:07.210 --> 00:12:08.870
I'll drink it all at once!

00:12:09.860 --> 00:12:14.970
Translator's note: reference to Suigintou in "Rozen Maiden", who is associated with probiotic drinks, voiced by Tanaka Rie, the VA for Ageha.

00:12:17.850 --> 00:12:19.710
I'm full of calcium!

00:12:20.210 --> 00:12:23.710
Wow, Ageha-chan is incredible, right Natose-san?

00:12:25.100 --> 00:12:25.930
What?

00:12:25.930 --> 00:12:29.260
Oh, Natose-san is pretty much the same.

00:12:29.260 --> 00:12:32.510
Geez, you all appreciate food more than flowers.

00:12:33.010 --> 00:12:36.100
Let's take it easy and watch the cherry blossoms.

00:12:36.100 --> 00:12:36.770
Right.

00:12:43.960 --> 00:12:45.780
A haiku just came to mind, De Niro.

00:12:45.780 --> 00:12:49.780
"Drinking under the flowers, the only relish I'm missing is boys in shorts."

00:12:50.610 --> 00:12:52.680
You have no sense at all.

00:12:53.520 --> 00:12:58.290
I'm despaired! Despaired of my robot who turns against his creator!

00:12:53.520 --> 00:12:58.290
Translator's note: This is a parody of Sayonara Zetsubou Sensei,
in which Miyu's VA voices Kobushi Abiru.

00:12:58.740 --> 00:13:04.800
So, now that we're getting into the mood,
let's begin with the parlor tricks.

00:13:04.800 --> 00:13:07.640
Oh, and are you going to start things off?

00:13:07.640 --> 00:13:13.470
No, but Natose-san will entertain you with funny American jokes.

00:13:13.470 --> 00:13:16.880
Huh? Why me, all of a sudden?

00:13:16.880 --> 00:13:19.030
Probably because it's funny.

00:13:19.560 --> 00:13:21.400
Don't raise the hurdle.

00:13:23.220 --> 00:13:25.240
Okay, make an impression on me!

00:13:25.240 --> 00:13:27.790
U-Um...

00:13:28.860 --> 00:13:33.200
Then... Hey, Michael, this TV set is big!

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:35.090
Didn't it cost a hundred grand?

00:13:35.090 --> 00:13:37.880
No, Bob, this was for free.

00:13:37.880 --> 00:13:40.460
Ooh, tell me the details.

00:13:40.460 --> 00:13:44.960
When I was at her place, she told me while undressing:

00:13:44.960 --> 00:13:47.510
"Hey, I'll give you whatever you want."

00:13:47.510 --> 00:13:51.010
So I brought this home with me.

00:13:52.230 --> 00:13:54.100
Good  job, Michael!

00:13:54.100 --> 00:13:59.100
Yeah, but she hit me afterwards,
costing me a hundred grand in medical bills.

00:14:00.250 --> 00:14:02.650
Yes, a compound fracture!

00:14:10.360 --> 00:14:11.620
Oh well.

00:14:12.660 --> 00:14:15.010
Everyone's eyes look as if they were dead.

00:14:15.010 --> 00:14:17.000
N-Natose-san...

00:14:17.750 --> 00:14:19.430
Yume, I'm sorry,

00:14:19.430 --> 00:14:21.210
sorry for being a servant who can't crack up the audience.

00:14:21.210 --> 00:14:23.670
F-Fight for it, Natose-san!

00:14:24.440 --> 00:14:26.160
Such a pitiful master-servant relationship.

00:14:26.160 --> 00:14:29.170
Okay, next it's my turn!

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:31.520
Hey, De Niro!

00:14:31.520 --> 00:14:34.350
I'll liven up things!

00:14:34.350 --> 00:14:36.560
Don' tell me you're going to liven it by...

00:14:38.330 --> 00:14:41.000
Listen to my song!

00:14:41.530 --> 00:14:42.880
Stop him, Ren!

00:14:42.880 --> 00:14:45.110
Huh? Er... Y-Yes!

00:14:45.460 --> 00:14:47.610
I'm De Niro.

00:14:52.030 --> 00:14:53.870
This is incredible!

00:14:55.140 --> 00:14:58.470
I can't get enough of this tingling sensation.

00:14:58.470 --> 00:15:01.500
Yes, as if my brain were seeping out.

00:15:02.340 --> 00:15:02.970
Hey!

00:15:02.970 --> 00:15:06.010
What are you doing to my recital?

00:15:06.010 --> 00:15:10.380
Your sonic waves were devised for attacking purposes, so you can't use it here!

00:15:10.780 --> 00:15:15.850
As the proud bearer of a De Niro-meister,
I can't allow you to bother people around you.

00:15:15.850 --> 00:15:18.430
I get the message, Mommy.

00:15:18.430 --> 00:15:20.930
Who are you calling "Mommy"?

00:15:21.780 --> 00:15:24.480
All right, it'll be me and Miyu next.

00:15:24.480 --> 00:15:27.330
Huh? Am I supposed to do something?

00:15:27.330 --> 00:15:29.690
Oh, it's a piece of cake, you loli.

00:15:30.100 --> 00:15:31.400
Preparations are ready.

00:15:35.480 --> 00:15:38.290
The Kuonji Sisters' Cosplay Show!

00:15:38.910 --> 00:15:41.480
Starting off with school uniforms!

00:15:45.050 --> 00:15:47.710
Uniforms don't look good on the adult person I am.

00:15:48.890 --> 00:15:51.260
I can still pass as a school girl.

00:15:54.270 --> 00:15:56.260
You think so? You look like someone from some shady shop.

00:15:57.830 --> 00:15:59.710
I-I'm only kidding.

00:15:59.710 --> 00:16:02.890
By the way, they're reacting strangely.

00:16:05.510 --> 00:16:09.000
Well, it's just that I wanted to see Miyu-tan's cosplay for myself.

00:16:09.000 --> 00:16:09.750
Hey!

00:16:10.290 --> 00:16:13.000
Come on, there's plenty of costumes left.

00:16:13.000 --> 00:16:15.660
H-Hey, let go!

00:16:16.310 --> 00:16:18.450
I'm the master and you're the maid.

00:16:19.250 --> 00:16:21.500
Well, at least it's something original.

00:16:22.200 --> 00:16:24.490
The fortune telling Shinra Shrine.

00:16:24.490 --> 00:16:25.500
Sounds like a bad shrine.

00:16:24.490 --> 00:16:28.250
Translator's note: A parody of the internet radio show
"Kaiun, Yabou Jinja", hosted by Itou Shizuka, the VA for Shinra.

00:16:30.500 --> 00:16:33.340
Answer me, are you my servant?

00:16:33.780 --> 00:16:35.340
What are you asking?

00:16:33.780 --> 00:16:38.600
Translator's note: Spoof of Saber and Tousaka Rin in "Fate/stay night."

00:16:35.740 --> 00:16:37.920
Wow, that was fun!

00:16:37.920 --> 00:16:40.680
The only one enjoying it was you, Nee-san.

00:16:37.930 --> 00:16:40.680
All that's left is to drink!

00:16:42.280 --> 00:16:44.790
Now it's my turn.

00:16:44.790 --> 00:16:46.400
Kojuurou, get ready.

00:16:48.290 --> 00:16:50.110
One moment, please.

00:16:51.520 --> 00:16:53.860
What is she going to do with that?

00:16:53.860 --> 00:16:57.200
There's no telling what those two are up to.

00:16:59.720 --> 00:17:01.080
Preparations are complete.

00:17:01.530 --> 00:17:04.220
So, let me show you a work of art.

00:17:17.650 --> 00:17:20.000
She's only kicking the steel pole?

00:17:20.520 --> 00:17:22.350
Wrong, Miyu-sama.

00:17:22.350 --> 00:17:24.510
She's carving a statue.

00:17:25.170 --> 00:17:26.450
You're kidding me.

00:17:32.170 --> 00:17:33.330
Finished.

00:17:34.980 --> 00:17:37.360
The Kuki specialty, foot carving!

00:17:38.610 --> 00:17:40.510
It looks just like him!

00:17:41.290 --> 00:17:43.450
I want to be carved by someone, too!

00:17:43.450 --> 00:17:45.410
Don't say such dangerous things!

00:17:45.410 --> 00:17:47.080
That's not what I meant.

00:17:47.080 --> 00:17:49.540
Oh.. I-I see... sorry.

00:17:50.320 --> 00:17:52.710
Ageha-sama!

00:17:52.710 --> 00:17:55.210
Look, isn't it sculpted nicely?

00:17:55.210 --> 00:17:57.680
I'm moved to tears!

00:17:57.680 --> 00:17:59.430
You're amazing, Ageha-chan!

00:17:59.430 --> 00:18:01.090
Just what I expected!

00:18:02.470 --> 00:18:06.480
All right, as an encore, I'll show you something else.

00:18:08.480 --> 00:18:10.730
This is my lethal kick!

00:18:17.990 --> 00:18:19.150
Such a waste.

00:18:19.150 --> 00:18:21.010
Poor guy.

00:18:21.010 --> 00:18:23.370
He never is rewarded, is he?

00:18:23.370 --> 00:18:26.180
Hey, it's your turn to show something.

00:18:26.180 --> 00:18:32.190
Yes! Then, I'll release the flaming dragon out of my arms.

00:18:26.180 --> 00:18:32.190
Translator's note: A parody of Hiei from "Yu Yu Hakusho", voiced by Hiyama Nobuyuki, the VA of Kojuurou.

00:18:34.900 --> 00:18:36.170
You idiot.

00:18:36.170 --> 00:18:38.760
Don't use a dangerous move like that over here.

00:18:38.760 --> 00:18:42.720
My apologies, Ageha-sama!

00:18:42.720 --> 00:18:44.300
We're going to do that trick.

00:18:44.300 --> 00:18:46.810
Very well, Ageha-sama!

00:18:47.280 --> 00:18:49.980
Kojuurou's specialty, top spinning!

00:18:49.980 --> 00:18:53.020
I'm being spun more than usual.

00:18:54.550 --> 00:18:58.740
Um, I think it's more like Ageha's specialty.

00:18:58.740 --> 00:19:01.010
I want to be spun around, too!

00:19:01.010 --> 00:19:03.420
I told you not to say such dangerous things!

00:19:03.420 --> 00:19:05.010
That's not what I meant.

00:19:05.010 --> 00:19:06.730
N-N-Not again.

00:19:06.730 --> 00:19:08.020
My bad.. my bad...

00:19:09.310 --> 00:19:10.910
Thieves!

00:19:17.070 --> 00:19:19.540
Kojuurou, destroy them!

00:19:19.540 --> 00:19:20.300
Roger!

00:19:20.300 --> 00:19:24.340
Such uncouth people to be stealing when people are having fun.

00:19:24.340 --> 00:19:26.880
Ren, Colonel, turn them into sashimi.

00:19:26.880 --> 00:19:27.530
Ma'am.

00:19:27.530 --> 00:19:28.520
Yes!

00:19:28.520 --> 00:19:30.640
I'll take care of one myself.

00:19:30.640 --> 00:19:31.580
De Niro.

00:19:31.580 --> 00:19:34.060
Right, leave it to me!

00:19:34.480 --> 00:19:37.610
Take this! Launch the missile barrage!

00:19:38.010 --> 00:19:39.990
De Niro Flash!

00:19:52.250 --> 00:19:53.580
Butler Kick!

00:19:53.580 --> 00:19:55.790
Butler Spin Kick!

00:19:59.550 --> 00:20:02.130
Good work. I'll give you fleshed bones later.

00:20:03.060 --> 00:20:04.890
So I'm the only one left, huh.

00:20:10.120 --> 00:20:11.600
You're the last one left.

00:20:12.750 --> 00:20:15.690
Looking at you closely, you're quite handsome.

00:20:16.410 --> 00:20:18.730
It's a pity you have to resort to robbery.

00:20:18.730 --> 00:20:21.070
You have to be punished.

00:20:26.000 --> 00:20:28.780
Come on, I'm going to knock some sense into you.

00:20:28.780 --> 00:20:31.020
This will hurt, but bear with me.

00:20:49.640 --> 00:20:51.390
The punishment has been administered.

00:20:51.390 --> 00:20:53.640
Though I might have gotten carried away.

00:20:53.640 --> 00:20:57.380
We have apprehended all of the suspects!

00:21:03.560 --> 00:21:06.990
Awesome! This has the potential for a scoop.

00:21:12.990 --> 00:21:16.000
It's not a bad idea to walk and sober up.

00:21:16.000 --> 00:21:18.850
Yume got tired from playing and fell asleep.

00:21:18.850 --> 00:21:20.000
She's such a kid.

00:21:21.190 --> 00:21:23.880
Kneel before me, commoners!

00:21:23.880 --> 00:21:27.470
Miyu-chan, shall I piggyback you as well?

00:21:27.470 --> 00:21:30.250
It's okay. I'm an adult, you know.

00:21:30.250 --> 00:21:32.100
You better not get muscle pains from walking.

00:21:32.100 --> 00:21:34.500
I'm going to shower once I'm back.

00:21:34.500 --> 00:21:36.650
Oh? Then, I'll join you.

00:21:36.650 --> 00:21:37.910
Yes!

00:21:37.910 --> 00:21:41.190
Then, let's head back home at once.

00:21:41.510 --> 00:21:44.070
Geez, such an energetic sister I have.

00:21:47.390 --> 00:21:49.570
What's the matter, Ren-chan?

00:21:53.850 --> 00:21:56.620
Head back home, huh.

00:22:00.530 --> 00:22:04.000
Looking forward to going home is a wonderful thing.

00:22:05.270 --> 00:22:07.130
Yes, it really is.

00:22:07.130 --> 00:22:12.180
It makes me feel so happy to know that we can stay here as long as we want.

00:22:12.660 --> 00:22:15.560
Let's work hard and return the favor.

00:22:15.560 --> 00:22:16.850
Yeah.

00:22:34.650 --> 00:22:36.540
Yo, son.

00:22:37.760 --> 00:22:40.580
I finally found you.

00:22:41.290 --> 00:22:44.000
So this is where you were.

00:24:10.570 --> 00:24:13.760
Ren-chan, isn't the Kuonji residence a wonderful place?

00:24:13.760 --> 00:24:17.020
Hato-nee, we siblings will be here forever.

00:24:17.020 --> 00:24:18.030
Yup yup!

00:24:18.030 --> 00:24:20.990
That's too bad, because Dad's now here!

00:24:22.200 --> 00:24:24.940
You're really an insensible person, aren't you?
